---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About" activePage="about">
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="page-header-content">
        <div class="page-accent-marks" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="m3"></span>
          <span class="m1"></span>
          <span class="m2"></span>
        </div>
        <h1>About <span class="title-ckt"><span class="c">C</span><span class="k">K</span><span class="t">T</span></span></h1>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="prose wrap">
    <p>
      Made by CKT Ltd is a small app studio based in Shropshire, UK. We
      design, build and maintain apps — some for fun, some for business, and
      some simply because we spotted a problem that needed fixing (and
      apparently couldn't leave it alone).
    </p>

    <p>
      Rather than joining the race to build yet another version of something
      that already has ten big players in it, we prefer to look for overlooked
      niches and create apps that are genuinely useful. Smaller ideas,
      perhaps, but ones we think deserve to exist.
    </p>

    <p>
      The studio was founded by <strong>Katie Mayers</strong> and
      <strong>Chris Hill</strong> — who also happen to be a couple. Yes, we
      were warned. Quite a lot, actually. Starting a business together was
      apparently going to be <em>a terrible idea</em>, and there were plenty
      of people willing to explain why.
    </p>

    <p>
      So far, we're still talking to each other.
    </p>

    <p>
      Between us, we cover both the design and engineering sides of the
      studio. Katie focuses on how things look and feel, while Chris makes
      sure everything works properly under the hood. That means every app gets
      looked at from both directions before it goes live — because a beautiful
      app that doesn't work is really just a very attractive problem.
    </p>

    <p>
      We're small by choice, which means we can keep things personal, move
      quickly and actually care about the details. No layers of management, no
      mysterious departments, and thankfully, no meetings about whether we
      need another meeting.
    </p>

    <p class="pull">
      We'd rather build one app that fits its audience precisely than five
      that fit no one in particular.
    </p>

    <p>
      Right now that means <strong>Bike AI</strong>, our first app under
      active development — a motorcycle ride companion that uses on-device
      AI to help riders plan routes, log their journeys, and make sense of
      the details that matter while out on the road. It is being built for
      riders rather than adapted from a generic ride tracker, and we'll share
      more as it nears release.
    </p>

    <p>
      Made by CKT Ltd is registered in England &amp; Wales, company number
      17451719. If you want to talk to us about a project, a partnership, or
      anything else, the <a href="/support">support page</a> has our contact
      details.
    </p>
  </section>
</Layout>
